# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# PTO Central — publish guard.
# This repo deploys to PUBLIC GitHub Pages (mybasepay.github.io/pto-central).
# Anything committed here becomes publicly downloadable. Internal working
# material stays local, matching the original publish precedent (the repo has
# only ever contained the app surface: pages, js/, lib/, components/).
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Internal documentation, flow notes, and provisioning scripts (contain
# process details, item ids, and names — keep off the public site).
docs/
flows/
scripts/
PTO_CENTRAL_ARCHITECTURE.md

# Dev/diagnostic pages and their fixtures (localhost-only; not linked from the app).
dev-*.html
dev-*.js
serve.json

# Placeholder modules for future phases (not loaded by any published page).
js/calendar.js
js/notify.js
js/pages/hr-dashboard.page.js
js/pages/hr-employee.page.js
# Pending-request reminder/escalation/auto-approval rules — mirrors a planned
# Power Automate flow (docs/PENDING_REQUEST_PROCESSOR_POWER_AUTOMATE.md) that
# does not exist yet. Pure/deterministic and independently useful later, but
# not wired into any production page today (see js/requests.js's duplicated
# 48h constant comment) — same "not loaded by any published page" precedent
# as the placeholders above.
js/pending-rules.js

# Editor / local tooling.
.vscode/

# Local dev-server logs and ad hoc QA screenshot/snapshot captures.
preview-server.log
preview-server.err
.codex-artifacts/
